[36m(TaskRunner pid=6902)[0m ### Task
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6902)[0m Today we will be implementing the rather chaotic recursive sequence of integers called Hofstadter Q.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6902)[0m The Hofstadter Q is defined as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6902)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6902)[0m As the author states in the aforementioned book:It is reminiscent of the Fibonacci definition in that each new value is a sum of two
