[36m(TaskRunner pid=6902)[0m Variation of this nice kata, the war has expanded and become dirtier and meaner; both even and odd numbers will fight with their pointy `1`s. And negative integers are coming into play as well, with, ça va sans dire, a negative contribution (think of them as spies or saboteurs).
