[36m(TaskRunner pid=6902)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6902)[0m `263` is a colorful number because `[2, 6, 3, 2*6, 6*3, 2*6*3]` are all different; whereas `236` is not colorful, because `[2, 3, 6, 2*3, 3*6, 2*3*6]` have `6` twice.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6902)[0m 
